					<h6 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Get Paid for Your Idle Assets</h6>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cfcd565 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cfcd565" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Unused racking doesn’t just take up space—it ties up capital. We help you recover value by turning your equipment into cash or credit toward your next project.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" data-slide="2" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 4">
