				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a9cc22 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4a9cc22" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;laptop&quot;,&quot;tablet_extra&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile_extra&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>We’ve removed racks from massive distribution centers, tight downtown warehouses, shared-use facilities, and crowded parking lots. Whether it’s a scheduled teardown or a just-in-time recovery, we bring the team, tools, and trucks to get the job done.</p>								</div>
